          "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: #ba372a; color: #ffffff;\"><strong> LISTENING </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #ba372a;\">Exercise 1</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\">Listen and fill in the gaps with ONE WORDS. <em>(Nghe và điền vào chỗ trống với 1 TỪ.)</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1775701449.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1775701459.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>3</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1775701475.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #242938; font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.5;\"><audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1775701494.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exercise 2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1772803653.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></span></p>\n<p> </p>",
