>[input_6]</strong></span> on personal improvement and flexibility. However, I also appreciate team sports for their <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_7] </strong></span>and cooperative aspects.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Do you prefer watching sports or playing sports?</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I prefer playing sports because it allows me to be <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_8]</strong></span> and involved. Watching sports is entertaining, but <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong><strong>[input_9]</strong></strong></span> provides greater physical and mental<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong> [input_10]</strong></span>.</span></p>"
